# CI Runner Convention

GitHub-hosted runners are the default for new workflow jobs — `runs-on: ubuntu-latest`, `windows-latest`, or `macos-latest`, whichever fits the job. `self-hosted` labels are retired; do not add `[self-hosted, ...]` to new or edited jobs. See AGENTS.md `## CI Contract (Required, SSOT)`, `docs/src/ci/runner-contract.md`, and `docs/src/ci/workflow-enumeration.md`.

**Env registry:** canonical `VOX_*` / Turso / orchestrator names — `docs/src/reference/env-vars.md` (redirect stubs: `docs/src/ref/env-vars.md`, `docs/src/ref/env-vars-ssot.md`).
